{"id":"gravistone","name":{"en":"Gravistone","ja":"グラビ石"},"desc":{"en":"Despite its appearance, it's as light as a feather. Some say the stone has gravity-defying properties. Hence the name.","ja":"見た目と異なり、まるで風船のように軽い石。 一説によれば、石自体が重力を操っていると いわれており、そこからこの名が付いた。そ の他に類をみない特質は極めて貴重。"},"level":6,"locations":[{"id":"primordial-island","name":{"en":"Primordial Island","ja":"原初の島"}},{"id":"grune-rainforest","name":{"en":"Grune Rainforest","ja":"グリューネ雨林"},"parent":"primordial-island"}],"traits":{"id":"earth-power","name":{"en":"Earth Power","ja":"大地の力"}},"categories":[{"id":"mystery","name":{"en":"(Mystery)","ja":"（神秘の力）"},"icon":"totori-category-mystery"},{"id":"ore","name":{"en":"(Ore)","ja":"（鉱石類）"},"icon":"totori-category-ore"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":28}